      "message": "Resolved (#20, browser render of @carbon/react 1.118.0): on ghost the svg element computes to icon-primary (.cds--btn--ghost:not([disabled]) svg), but every icon path matches .cds--btn--ghost .cds--btn__icon path:not([data-icon-path]):not([fill=none]) { fill: currentColor }, so the visible fill equals the label colour: link-primary, link-primary-hover on hover and active, text-disabled when disabled. danger--ghost follows its label too. Checked on all 9 preferred icons (single path each, no data-icon-path), White and G100. sameAs Label.fill stands; icon-primary stays out of the closure."
    },
